---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { pathFor } from '../../../lib/site';
const puzzlePrompt =
  '用 REA 检查 /abs/path/to/our-job-runner。为什么重试等待是 1s、2s、4s 然后停止？引用延迟函数。不要改文件。';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="zh"
  title="什么是逆向工程？| rea.run"
  description="面向建造者的逆向指南：证据、授权，以及可交互的重试退避谜题。"
  path="/learn/what-is-reverse-engineering/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="badge badge-accent">学习</p>
      <h1 class="display mt-4 text-[clamp(2.2rem,4.5vw,3.4rem)]">什么是逆向工程？</h1>
      <p class="lede mt-5">
        通过检查软件制品本身弄清行为——直到你能解释某功能、在许可范围内修改，或重建兼容实现。
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">
        仅限授权目标。<a class="quiet-link" href={pathFor('zh', '/compliance/')}>合规说明</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
      <div class="card reveal"><p class="kicker">01 · 观察</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">输入、输出、时序、副作用——不轻信宣传页。</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal delay-1"><p class="kicker">02 · 还原</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">定位实现该规则的代码路径；保留地址与路径。</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal delay-2"><p class="kicker">03 · 解释</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">把规则说清楚，方便同事（或未来的你）核实与重建。</p></div>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] items-start">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">智能体如何改变循环</p>
        <h2 class="display mt-2 text-3xl">Evidence 进来，判断仍归人</h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)] leading-7">
          配备本地工具的编程智能体能更快收集字符串、符号、反编译（自备引擎）与 JS 图。
          你仍要核实引用、拒绝未授权目标，并批准写入。
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">
          <li class="rail">要 Evidence 与未知项——不要空话。</li>
          <li class="rail">给绝对路径，指向你有权检查的制品。</li>
          <li class="rail">打开引用位置之前，把智能体叙述当草稿。</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="split-band">
        <p class="kicker !text-[#9ec0ff]">好答案长什么样</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm text-[#d5dceb]">
          <li>具名函数／地址与文件路径</li>
          <li>清楚的未解析边</li>
          <li>没有「大概用了 AI」式填充</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn mt-6 !bg-[var(--color-paper)] !text-[var(--color-ink)] !shadow-[4px_4px_0_#c8432a]" href={pathFor('zh', '/docs/install/')}>安装 REA</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <p class="kicker">原创谜题</p>
      <h2 class="display mt-2 text-3xl max-w-3xl">重试退避：1s → 2s → 4s → 停止</h2>
      <p class="lede mt-4">宣传页写「智能重试」。逆向要问：哪个函数算延迟，上限是什么？</p>

      <div class="demo-shell mt-8" data-backoff data-idle-log="点击播放，观看加速演示的指数退避。">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <p class="kicker">退避实验室</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">等待节奏的微交互——不是实时 REA 会话。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <button type="button" class="demo-btn" data-backoff-play>播放</button>
            <button type="button" class="demo-btn ghost" data-backoff-reset>重置</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="backoff-track mt-3" data-backoff-track><div class="backoff-fill" data-backoff-fill></div></div>
        <div class="flex justify-between mt-2 font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-[var(--color-muted)]">
          <span>1s</span><span>2s</span><span>4s</span><span>停止</span>
        </div>
        <div class="backoff-log" data-backoff-log></div>
      </div>

      <div class="demo-shell mt-5" data-demo-tabs>
        <div class="demo-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="之前与之后">
          <button type="button" class="demo-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="zh-learn-before" aria-selected="true">之前 · 独自挖</button>
          <button type="button" class="demo-tab" role="tab" aria-controls="zh-learn-after" aria-selected="false">之后 · 智能体 + REA</button>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5" id="zh-learn-before" data-panel>
          <div class="step-row"><span class="step-index">01</span><div><strong>找到调度器</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">搜配置、加日志。</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-row"><span class="step-index">02</span><div><strong>解码延迟</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">线性、封顶，还是指数？</p></div></div>
          <div class="step-row"><span class="step-index">03</span><div><strong>命名停止条件</strong><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-[var(--color-muted)]">最大次数、最大延迟，或两者？</p></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5" id="zh-learn-after" data-panel hidden>
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--color-ink-soft)]">把 REA 指向你有权检查的代码；要求带位置的延迟函数，由你核实。</p>
          <div class="copy-row mt-4">
            <div class="code-well" id="zh-learn-puzzle"><span class="prompt">›</span> {puzzlePrompt}</div>
            <button type="button" class="copy-btn" data-copy="#zh-learn-puzzle" data-copied-label="已复制">复制</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-16 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a class="btn" href={pathFor('zh', '/examples/')}>浏览示例</a>
      <a class="btn-secondary" href={pathFor('zh', '/showcase/')}>社区案例墙</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
